    "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/developing-today/code/pull/7981?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\" alt=\"Explain Change →\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- recent_review_status_start -->\n\nNo actionable comments were generated in the recent review.\n\n<!-- recent_review_status_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\nThe shell pool list now includes a healthy Mistral AI pool with no dated windows and a note about its live quota overlay. The quota test expects Mistral in the pool order and describes dated reads as the live read’s fail-soft fallback.\n\n**Changes: Mistral quota pool**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Register Mistral shell pool** <br> `pm-stack/aggregator/src/quota-extract.ts`, `pm-stack/aggregator/test/quota.test.ts`|Adds a healthy Mistral AI pool with no dated windows and a note about its live quota overlay. Updates the test comment and expected pool order.|\n\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n**Estimated code review effort:** 1 (Trivial) | ~3 minutes\n\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"865f2ce7bcb198d7be9773bd972c36dd4782e305\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p3\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Bug fix\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-unassessed-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Minimal</strong> · up to <code>865f2</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **⚪ Minimal** · up to `865f2`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"865f2ce7bcb198d7be9773bd972c36dd4782e305\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"865f2ce7bcb198d7be9773bd972c36dd4782e305\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nThis change registers Mistral as a quota pool with a stable identity and updates the pool-order test. No concrete merge-blocking risk was identified.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Pre-merge checks: <sup><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-counter-passed-14-v2.svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" align=\"middle\" alt=\"Passed\" title=\"Passed\"></picture></sup> 4</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n|         Check name         |                                             Status                                             | Explanation                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| :------------------------ | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n|      Description Check     | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | Check skipped - CodeRabbit’s high-level summary is enabled.                                                                                                                                               |\n|         Title check        | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | The title names the main change: registering the Mistral pool in quota attribution. The raw summary says SHELL_POOLS now includes a Mistral pool, and the test expectation adds mistral. The title is sp… |\n|     Linked Issues check    | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | Check skipped because no linked issues were found for this pull request.                                                                                                                                  |\n| Out of Scope Changes check | ![Passed](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/pre-merge-checks-passed.svg) | Check skipped because no linked issues were found for this pull request.                                                                                                                                  |\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Full details: Title check</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n**Explanation**\n\nThe title names the main change: registering the Mistral pool in quota attribution. The raw summary says SHELL_POOLS now includes a Mistral pool, and the test expectation adds mistral. The title is specific and matches the changeset. The conventional-commit prefix 'fix(aggregator)' fits the aggregator change. Length is 63 characters, which is acceptable.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- pre_merge_checks_walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Finishing Touches</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Generat